173
00:10:36,160 --> 00:10:38,160
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What an incredible kid!</font>

174
00:10:38,160 --> 00:10:40,000
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">He certainly is an astounding youth.</font>

175
00:10:40,000 --> 00:10:43,900
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">He's going to save the world someday.</font>

176
00:10:43,900 --> 00:10:46,040
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What do you mean?!</font>

177
00:10:46,040 --> 00:10:48,070
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Goku's going to save the world?!</font>

178
00:10:48,070 --> 00:10:53,170
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I'm sure of it. I just get
