179
00:10:54,940 --> 00:10:57,170
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I wouldn't be surprised...</font>

180
00:11:00,560 --> 00:11:02,860
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Look! We made it to Karin!</font>

181
00:11:05,800 --> 00:11:07,920
