183
00:11:20,790 --> 00:11:23,980
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Okay! Let's get your wish granted!</font>

184
00:11:24,890 --> 00:11:26,450
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">R-Right!</font>

185
00:11:28,800 --> 00:11:32,860
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Shen Long! Come out!</font>

186
00:11:54,820 --> 00:11:57,090
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">The sky turned dark!</font>

187
00:12:39,800 --> 00:12:41,600
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">It's so bright!</font>

188
00:13:17,740 --> 00:13:20,710
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">It's so awesome!</font>

189
00:13:20,710 --> 00:13:22,940
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">T-That's Shen Long?</font>

190
00:13:55,840 --> 00:14:00,250
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">State your wish!</font>

191
00:14:00,250 --> 00:14:02,920
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I-lt can talk!</font>

192
00:14:02,920 --> 00:14:04,650
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Upa! The wish!</font>

193
00:14:04,650 --> 00:14:06,020
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">R-Right!</font>

194
00:14:18,810 --> 00:14:24,040
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Please! Bring my
