195
00:14:31,830 --> 00:14:34,730
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Can you do that?</font>

196
00:14:34,730 --> 00:14:38,830
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">A simple task. I shall make it so.</font>

197
00:14:38,830 --> 00:14:43,900
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">See! I told you there was
