198
00:14:56,890 --> 00:14:59,220
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Father's grave!</font>

199
00:15:32,090 --> 00:15:34,250
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">F-Father!</font>

200
00:15:37,060 --> 00:15:38,790
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Father!</font>

201
00:15:40,090 --> 00:15:42,120
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Father!</font>

202
00:15:44,830 --> 00:15:46,800
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Father!</font>

203
00:15:48,870 --> 00:15:52,110
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Father! Father! Father!</font>

204
00:15:52,110 --> 00:15:54,070
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Father!</font>

205
00:15:57,310 --> 00:15:58,900
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Father!</font>

206
00:16:10,790 --> 00:16:14,730
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I'm so glad, Father!</font>

207
00:16:14,730 --> 00:16:17,200
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Oh? I was certain that I had been...</font>

