213
00:16:53,130 --> 00:16:54,070
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">...is that one!</font>

214
00:17:04,380 --> 00:17:07,840
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Why did you jump up just now, Goku-<i>san</i>?</font>

215
