221
00:17:31,270 --> 00:17:34,040
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Son Goku! Thank you very much!</font>

222
00:17:34,040 --> 00:17:36,210
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I'm glad you're alive again!</font>

223
00:17:36,210 --> 00:17:41,210
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">We are eternally grateful for all your help!</font>

224
00:17:41,220 --> 00:17:44,220
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Goku-<i>san</i> climbed Karin Tower!</font>

225
00:17:44,220 --> 00:17:48,120
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">He also took care of the guy
