226
00:17:48,120 --> 00:17:50,750
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Son Goku is like a child of the gods...</font>

227
00:17:51,890 --> 00:17:54,030
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Well, I gotta go!</font>

228
00:17:54,030 --> 00:17:56,060
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You're leaving already?</font>

229
00:17:56,060 --> 00:17:59,400
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Stay here a little longer.
