235
00:18:14,980 --> 00:18:21,420
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Farewell! I'm sure we'll meet again!</font>

236
00:18:21,420 --> 00:18:23,860
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Goku-<i>san</i>!</font>

237
00:18:33,870 --> 00:18:38,910
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Upa. Live your life with spirit
and strength like Goku-<i>san</i> does!</font>

238
00:18:38,910 --> 00:18:41,010
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Father!</font>

239
00:18:41,010 --> 00:18:43,910
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I'm going to try climbing
