240
00:18:45,150 --> 00:18:46,980
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I can't now...</font>

241
00:18:48,760 --> 00:18:52,290
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">But one day I will, just like Goku-<i>san</i>.</font>

242
00:18:53,450 --> 00:18:56,290
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Thank you, Goku-<i>san</i>!</font>

243
00:19:07,080 --> 00:19:09,080
