244
00:19:09,080 --> 00:19:10,250
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Hey!</font>

245
00:19:10,250 --> 00:19:13,690
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Well? Did his old man come back to life?!</font>

246
00:19:13,690 --> 00:19:15,360
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Yeah! He sure did!</font>

247
00:19:15,360 --> 00:19:16,520
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">That's great!</font>

248
00:19:16,520 --> 00:19:19,160
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">He must've been really happy!</font>

249
00:19:19,160 --> 00:19:20,090
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Yeah!</font>

250
00:19:20,090 --> 00:19:22,090
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">That was something quite
