<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Hey, now!</font>

253
00:19:31,070 --> 00:19:33,370
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">He's honestly going to save the world?</font>

254
00:19:34,380 --> 00:19:36,310
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Don't ask me...</font>

255
00:19:36,310 --> 00:19:38,110
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">That feels better!</font>

256
00:19:38,110 --> 00:19:41,380
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">But now you're finally done
