258
00:19:45,820 --> 00:19:47,120
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Son-<i>kun</i>?</font>

259
00:19:49,220 --> 00:19:53,230
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I caught the Four-Star Ball
