263
00:20:03,870 --> 00:20:05,840
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">About that, Goku...</font>

264
00:20:05,840 --> 00:20:11,310
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Muten Roshi-<i>sama</i> is allowing me to
