270
00:20:26,190 --> 00:20:28,430
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Not in your case.</font>

271
00:20:28,430 --> 00:20:32,770
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You are already quite strong, but you
wish to grow even stronger, correct?</font>

272
00:20:32,770 --> 00:20:36,670
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Yeah. I wanna get even stronger...</font>

273
00:20:36,670 --> 00:20:41,480
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Then there is no point in
having me train you any further!</font>

274
00:20:41,480 --> 00:20:46,480
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Instead, you should go out into the
world and learn even more things!</font>

275
00:20:46,480 --> 00:20:48,520
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">The world is a big place.</font>

276
00:20:48,520 --> 00:20:52,150
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Something even greater
