277
00:20:52,150 --> 00:20:54,860
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You possess unknown potential!</font>

278
00:20:54,860 --> 00:20:57,720
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Grow even stronger and surprise me!</font>

279
00:20:57,730 --> 00:21:01,420
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>Brilliant! I'm a natural!</i></font>

280
