<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I'm certain it will be!</font>

282
00:21:09,770 --> 00:21:11,500
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Then I'll do that!</font>

283
00:21:11,500 --> 00:21:14,370
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Then let's meet again at the
