286
00:21:20,050 --> 00:21:21,780
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">No, three years.</font>

287
00:21:21,780 --> 00:21:23,580
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">With the increase in participants,</font>

288
00:21:23,580 --> 00:21:26,820
