295
00:21:42,900 --> 00:21:45,540
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Good luck, Goku-<i>san</i>!</font>

296
00:21:45,540 --> 00:21:48,840
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I wonder if you'll finally be calmed
