299
00:21:57,050 --> 00:21:59,810
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I'm gonna grow too, you know!</font>

300
00:22:02,060 --> 00:22:03,720
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Well, I'm gonna go now!</font>

301
00:22:03,720 --> 00:22:05,660
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Old-timer! Old lady! Take care!</font>

302
