308
00:22:20,510 --> 00:22:23,510
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">All around the world without <i>Kinto Un</i>?!</font>

309
00:22:23,510 --> 00:22:24,940
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Talk about hard training!</font>

310
00:22:24,940 --> 00:22:27,940
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">His training regimen's that intense?!</font>

311
00:22:31,020 --> 00:22:32,850
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Well, whatever!</font>

312
00:22:32,850 --> 00:22:34,550
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">See you later!</font>

313
00:22:37,280 --> 00:22:39,410
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">He's as free-spirited as ever...</font>

314
00:22:39,410 --> 00:22:42,550
