317
00:22:50,520 --> 00:22:52,450
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">With your pride as his master on the line,</font>

318
00:22:52,450 --> 00:22:54,890
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">you're not allowed to lose to him!</font>

319
00:22:54,890 --> 00:22:58,850
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Alright, then! Let us at
